-- an appeal that was transferred to the Court of Appeal under section 29D(1): limb (c)
#ASSERT (`Under section 53(2), is my matter one of the matters of the civil jurisdiction of the Court of Appeal` `District Court` `original jurisdiction` `a civil proceeding` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- an application raising a common question with a criminal matter: limb (d)
#ASSERT (`Under section 53(2), is my matter one of the matters of the civil jurisdiction of the Court of Appeal` `District Court` `original jurisdiction` `a civil proceeding` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
