#ASSERT (`Under section 53(2), is my matter one of the matters of the civil jurisdiction of the Court of Appeal` `District Court` `original jurisdiction` `a civil proceeding` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
