#ASSERT (`Under section 49(1), does the Court of Appeal have jurisdiction over my matter` `District Court` `original jurisdiction` `a civil proceeding` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
